sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant SC as shortcuts.rs
  participant W as window.rs
  participant VS as VoiceSessions
  participant L as lib.rs
  participant O as Overlay
  participant A as Target app
  U->>SC: press hotkey
  SC->>W: remember_target (foreground HWND)
  SC->>VS: start()
  SC->>W: show_overlay
  VS-->>O: state listening, level, partial
  U->>SC: release hotkey (hold) / press again (toggle)
  SC->>VS: stop(false)
  VS-->>L: transcript
  alt review on
    L->>W: set_overlay_review(true)
    L-->>O: state review
    U->>O: edit, Ctrl+Enter
    O->>L: dictation_confirm(text)
    L->>W: restore_target, wait 150 ms
    L->>A: type / paste text
  else review off
    L->>A: LiveTyper.finish(text)
  end
  L-->>O: state inserted
  L->>W: hide_overlay_later
